  "reply": "To add a custom pharmacy, open the patient’s chart (Patients > Chart > Demographics) and select the Pharmacy tab. Click **Add Custom Pharmacy**, enter the required fields (Name, Address, Phone, Fax), and then click **Save Entry**. Only staff with Medical Assistant or Provider roles can do this, and the entry will be limited to your clinic’s database until verified by network administrators."
}
